    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ASTRID DE GROOT&quot;" target="&quot;SHUTTLESHIFTER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"ShuttleShifter, a contributor to the badminton tournament focus list, compiled an exhaustive database of tournament results, inspiring Astrid de Groot's engagement in the project."</data>
